# Internationalization

- Put user-facing popup and content-panel text in `src/i18n/resources.ts`.
- Use `react-i18next` in React components and the shared i18next instance in content code.
- Keep English and Danish resource keys structurally identical.
- Do not localize protocol values, event tags, URLs, storage keys, or log identifiers.
- Use interpolation for counts and runtime values instead of string concatenation.
- Add resource tests when introducing a locale or changing resource structure.
- Keep the content script as a self-contained IIFE via `vite.content.config.ts`.
